## Install

```
pip install -e .[mcp,sila,test]
```

## Use

```python
from {{ ctx.package }} import {{ ctx.class_name }}

with {{ ctx.class_name }}.connect({{ ctx.default_resource|tojson }}) as driver:
{% if ctx.first_query %}
    print(driver.{{ ctx.first_query.method }}())
{% else %}
    ...
{% endif %}
```

`{{ ctx.class_name }}.connect("tcp://127.0.0.1:5025")` talks to the replay simulator
(`python -m {{ ctx.package }}.simulator --port 5025`) or to a network bridge.

